## 2. Database Migration Breakdown

### Migration Summary

| Component | Legacy (MongoDB) | Current (Supabase PostgreSQL) |
|---|---|---|
| **Driver / SDK** | `mongoose` v8.9.5 | `@supabase/supabase-js` v2.115.0 |
| **Data Types** | BSON Documents & Schemas | Relational Tables, UUIDs, JSONB, ENUMs |
| **Security** | MongoDB Atlas IP Whitelist | PostgreSQL Row Level Security (RLS) Policies |
| **Performance** | Compound Mongoose Indexes | PostgreSQL B-Tree Indexes on `timestamp`, `zone`, `worker_id` |
| **Reliability** | Database connection crash risk | Dual-layer with graceful in-memory fallback buffer |

