## 4. API Endpoints & Interfaces

### REST Endpoints Base: `http://localhost:8080/api/v1`

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/health` | Service uptime and healthcheck probe |
| `GET` | `/workers` or `/workers/roster` | Fetch all underground active workers (filterable by zone) |
| `POST` | `/workers` | Enroll new miner in database |
| `POST` | `/workers/scan` | AI computer vision PPE scan evaluation & turnstile barrier control |
| `GET` | `/incidents` | Fetch active/historical incidents (filterable by `acknowledged`) |
| `POST` | `/incidents` | Dispatch manual safety alert & broadcast over WebSocket |
| `POST` / `PATCH` | `/incidents/:id/acknowledge` | Acknowledge safety warning |
| `POST` | `/incidents/:id/signoff` | Statutory supervisor sign-off with badge signature |
| `GET` | `/telemetry/live` | Live telemetry snapshot across all 5 mine zones |
| `GET` | `/telemetry/historical` | Time-series query with 1h/24h/7d/30d rollups |
| `POST` | `/simulation/scenario` | Inject environmental anomalies (e.g. `GAS_LEAK_ZONE_B`, `PPE_NON_COMPLIANCE`, `EMERGENCY_EVACUATION`) |
| `GET` | `/turnstile/status` | Read hardware turnstile barrier GPIO status |
| `POST` | `/turnstile/override` | Manual supervisor turnstile barrier override |

### Real-Time WebSocket Channel
- **URL**: `ws://localhost:8080/api/v1/mine-safety/stream`
- **Envelope Types**:
  - `HEARTBEAT` (Handshake & latency monitoring)
  - `TELEMETRY_PACKET` (Broadcast every 1.2s across mine zones)
  - `WORKER_PPE_INFERENCE` (Edge AI camera scan events)
  - `INCIDENT_ALERT` (Emergency alarms & safety alerts)

