## 6. How to Connect Your Remote Supabase Project

1. Log in to [Supabase Console](https://supabase.com/dashboard).
2. Create a new project or select an existing one.
3. Open **SQL Editor**, paste and execute [supabase-schema.sql](file:///c:/Users/shiva/Desktop/Shivan/Coal%20Mine/backend/supabase-schema.sql).
4. In **Project Settings** $\rightarrow$ **API**, copy your **Project URL** and **API Key**.
5. Update `backend/.env`:
   ```env
   SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
   SUPABASE_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-or-anon-key
   ```
6. Run the database seed script:
   ```bash
   npm run seed
   ```
